===== T3d2 SHARED DSN lands the SAME application_name on both pools =====
{
  "p2_psycopg_pid": 2325876,
  "asyncpg_pid": 2325878,
  "application_names": {
    "2325876": "ensemble-shared-dsn",
    "2325878": "ensemble-shared-dsn"
  },
  "verdict": "CONFIRMED: a shared conn_string cannot separate the P2 psycopg saver pool from the asyncpg adapter pool \u2014 a SEPARATE DSN is required to attribute the asyncpg pool"
}
